  "faqExportDataAnswer": "Go to Settings > Data Management > CSV Management. You can export providers, currencies, and fee intervals as CSV files. These can be used for backup or to import into other instances of the app.",
  "@faqExportDataAnswer": {
    "description": "FAQ answer"
  },
